# Buffr G2P Mobile – Cursor Rules

- **Backend and database only.** All user-facing data (wallets, transactions, vouchers, contacts, profile, agents, bills, loans, groups) comes from the API. When the API is configured, call it; on failure, surface errors or empty results.
- **AI Companion:** Backend only.
- **Auth:** Production uses backend OTP and user/card endpoints. When API is unset, local generation is for development only.
- See `docs/DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md` for full rules.
